Атрибуты: `user_id` (string, indexed), `file_path` (string, Appwrite file ID), `duration` (integer, сек), `file_size` (integer, байт), `transcription` (string, nullable), `telegram_file_id` (string, nullable), `created_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/voice-messages-repo.ts`

