Атрибуты: `category` (string: identity/preference/limitation/etc), `content` (string), `source` (string: system/learned), `is_active` (boolean), `created_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/ai/self-core.ts` → `selfCoreRepo`

### amina_digest_caches — кэш дайджестов
Атрибуты: `pipeline` (string), `cache_key` (string, indexed), `digest_date` (string, YYYY-MM-DD), `city` (string), `source_hash` (string), `payload` (string — **JSON**), `expires_at` (string), `last_error` (string, nullable), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
