### amina_digest_deliveries — доставка дайджестов
Атрибуты: `pipeline` (string), `delivery_key` (string, indexed), `delivery_kind` (string: scheduled/manual), `user_id` (string), `chat_id` (integer), `city` (string), `digest_date` (string), `cache_key` (string), `status` (string: sending/sent/failed), `attempt_count` (integer), `last_error` (string, nullable), `sent_at` (string, nullable), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
