Атрибуты: `scenario_id` (string, unique), `name` (string), `enabled` (boolean), `call_mode` (string: speech/ask_question), `runtime_mode` (string: scripted/autonomous), `policy_version` (integer), `policy` (string — **JSON**), `goal` (string), `system_prompt` (string), `opening_line` (string), `question_hint` (string), `success_criteria` (string), `result_prompt` (string), `max_speech_chars` (integer, default 420), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
