Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-session-repo.ts`

### amina_tel_events — события звонков
Атрибуты: `session_id` (string, indexed), `event_type` (string), `provider_event_id` (string, nullable), `payload` (string — **JSON**), `created_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-event-repo.ts`

### amina_tel_turns — реплики в звонках
Атрибуты: `session_id` (string, indexed), `turn_index` (integer), `speaker` (string: user/assistant/system), `source` (string), `content` (string), `confidence` (float, nullable), `created_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-turn-repo.ts`

### amina_tel_outcomes — результаты звонков
Атрибуты: `session_id` (string, unique per session), `outcome_label` (string), `result_summary` (string), `confidence` (float, nullable), `metadata` (string — **JSON**), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-outcome-repo.ts`

### amina_tel_artifacts — артефакты звонков (записи, транскрипты)
Атрибуты: `session_id` (string, indexed), `artifact_type` (string: recording/transcript/etc), `status` (string), `url` (string, nullable), `storage_path` (string, nullable), `content` (string, nullable), `mime_type` (string, nullable), `size_bytes` (integer, nullable), `duration_ms` (integer, nullable), `checksum_sha256` (string, nullable), `archive_status` (string, nullable), `retention_until` (string, nullable), `version` (integer, default 1), `metadata` (string — **JSON**), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-artifact-repo.ts`

### amina_tel_jobs — фоновые задачи (postcall analysis)
Атрибуты: `session_id` (string, indexed), `job_type` (string), `status` (string: pending/running/done/failed), `dedupe_key` (string), `attempts` (integer), `max_attempts` (integer), `next_run_at` (string), `locked_at` (string, nullable), `payload` (string — **JSON**), `last_error` (string, nullable), `created_at` (string), `updated_at` (string)
Repo: `bot/src/features/telephony/repository/call-job-repo.ts`

