## Appwrite Code Patterns

### Upsert:
```typescript
const r = await aw.listDocuments(DB_ID(), COLL, [Query.equal('key', value), Query.limit(1)]);
if (r.documents.length > 0) {
  await aw.updateDocument(DB_ID(), COLL, r.documents[0]!.$id, data);
} else {
  await aw.createDocument(DB_ID(), COLL, ID.unique(), data);
}
```

### Pagination:
```typescript
const allDocs = [];
let offset = 0;
while (true) {
  const r = await aw.listDocuments(DB_ID(), COLL, [Query.limit(100), Query.offset(offset)]);
  allDocs.push(...r.documents);
  if (r.documents.length < 100) break;
  offset += 100;
}
```

### JSON fields:
```typescript
// Write: JSON.stringify
await aw.createDocument(DB_ID(), COLL, ID.unique(), { messages: JSON.stringify(arr), metadata: JSON.stringify(obj) });
// Read: JSON.parse
const messages = JSON.parse(doc.messages);
```

## Known Issues

- Appwrite has no native JSON type — all complex data is string
- Appwrite has no upsert — use list + create/update pattern
- Appwrite attribute max size is 1MB
- 502 during deploys breaks Telegram webhook

## MCP Setup (Cursor)

Кастомный MCP сервер `appwrite-mcp-custom` — 38 tools, Console-level доступ через email/password.
Настройка (одноразово):
```bash
cd /путь/к/Amina-bot-1
git clone https://github.com/antsincgame/appwrite-mcp-custom.git
cd appwrite-mcp-custom && npm install
```
В глобальном конфиге Cursor `args` указывают на `.../Amina-bot-1/appwrite-mcp-custom/src/index.js`. После клонирования перезапустить Cursor.
